   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(1)>本艦がアフリカで受けた砲撃だが、\n本部が発射元を割り出すことに成功した。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(1)>Regarding the bombardment we took\nin Africa, HQ has pinpointed its source.",
   "notes": ""
  },
