    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>発射元は、衛星軌道上の<im(11)>#c[BE5050]軍事衛星#cだ。\n旧時代の物で、今は使われておらんが、\nまだ何百も漂っていると言われている代物だ。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>It came from an orbital<im(11)> #c[BE5050]military satellite#c.\nAn obsolete relic no longer in use, yet\nhundreds are said to still drift out there.",
   "notes": "fix: token order <im(11)> before #c[BE5050] and line wrapped under 430 px -> repositioned <im(11)> and shortened line 2"
  },
  {
